  verified-against: live escape-string-regexp@1.0.5 in the provided temp install (2026-06-23):
    - confirmed the regex class members and that '-' '/' and non-listed punctuation are NOT escaped;
    - confirmed replacement is a single leading backslash per escapable char;
    - confirmed all non-string types (incl. boxed String, Symbol, NaN, missing arg) throw
      TypeError('Expected a string'); confirmed '' returns ''.
